v 0.000000 -11.000000 22.000000 0.220000 0.460000 0.920000
s off
f 9 11 12
f 9 12 13
f 9 13 14
f 9 14 11
f 10 12 11
f 10 13 12
f 10 14 13
f 10 11 14

o Accent_Tetrahedron
